  "title": "Warm Crunchy Vietnamese Sesame Spring Rolls",
  "description": "A resinous and crumbly Vietnamese dish featuring sesame butter and tempering chocolate, friendly to ayurvedic tamasic diets",
  "cuisine": "vietnamese",
